&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Mission Brief&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast="none"&gt;Isar Aerospace is seeking a &lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast="none"&gt;Senior Computational Engineering Architect&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast="none"&gt; to establish and drive the long-term vision, standards, methodologies, and digital infrastructure underpinning engineering analysis across current and future launch vehicle programs. You will be responsible for transforming simulation, modeling, optimization, and digital engineering capabilities into a scalable and strategic company asset, ensuring consistency, traceability, automation, and engineering excellence across all disciplines.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props="{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast="none"&gt;Working closely with the Chief Engineer, Product &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast="none"&gt;Principal&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast="none"&gt; Engineers, Systems Engineering, Software Platform Team, Design &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast="none"&gt;Teams&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast="none"&gt;, and IT functions, you will define the future state of engineering analysis, simulation governance, AI-enabled engineering, and the digital thread across the organization. You will ensure that engineering decisions are supported by robust, repeatable, and validated analytical processes while enabling rapid design iteration, optimization, and technology development.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props="{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Your Role in Our Space Mission:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Own CAE standards and methodology.&lt;/strong&gt; Define company-wide standards, best practices and verification methods, and keep simulation workflows consistent across CFD, FEA, thermal, acoustics and multiphysics.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Govern tools and licences.&lt;/strong&gt; Be the technical authority for CAE software: version management, qualification, roadmaps, licensing, vendor relationships, capability planning and utilisation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bring in new methods.&lt;/strong&gt; Evaluate, validate and deploy new simulation technologies, and set up advanced practices such as optimisation, uncertainty quantification and surrogate modelling.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lead AI-driven engineering.&lt;/strong&gt; Identify high-value use cases, set validation and governance practices, and build agent-based analysis and automated design space exploration, while keeping engineering rigour and traceability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Automate at scale.&lt;/strong&gt; Define automation frameworks, scripting standards and workflow orchestration across engineering teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build the digital thread.&lt;/strong&gt; Develop simulation-data architectures and model management, and integrate CAE with MBSE, PLM and engineering lifecycle processes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Drive reuse and enable teams.&lt;/strong&gt; Promote reuse of models, templates and libraries across programs, and support engineers with methodology development, training and coaching.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Connect the ecosystem.&lt;/strong&gt; Work with IT, data engineering, software, systems engineering and discipline leads to make sure the computational engineering environment works as one.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Qualification Checklist&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A Master's or PhD in Aerospace, Mechanical or Computational Engineering, Physics, Applied Mathematics, Systems Engineering or a related field.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;At least 8 years in aerospace, defence, nuclear, automotive, motorsport or another highly demanding engineering industry.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep experience in at least one analysis domain, such as CFD, FEA, thermal, structural dynamics, acoustics, combustion, fluid systems or multiphysics, and a solid understanding of simulation across the full product lifecycle.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A track record of developing and governing simulation methods, standards and processes, including verification, validation, model correlation and simulation credibility, and documenting them clearly.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building automation frameworks or computational environments for scalable, repeatable workflows, including HPC, cloud or distributed computing.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience with tools such as ANSYS, Siemens Simcenter, STAR-CCM+, Abaqus, Nastran, MATLAB/Simulink, Python or OpenMDAO.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with MBSE, requirements management and engineering data management.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience managing technical interfaces across disciplines, organisations and levels of seniority, with strong analytical, organisational and communication skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluent English, written and spoken.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Bonus Skills&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast="auto"&gt;Experience with launch vehicles, spacecraft, propulsion systems, or other large-scale aerospace systems.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast="auto"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props="{&amp;quot;134233279&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:360}"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast="auto"&gt;Experience with multidisciplinary design analysis and optimization (MDAO), design space exploration, or system-level optimization techniques.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props="{&amp;quot;134233279&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:360}"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
